 was next, where T\u00e4uber took an immediate lead with his fast Alfa Romeo.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":0,"text":"Chiron and Dreyfus pull away in their Bugattis, Caracciola close behind in third; Broschek starts badly.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":1,"text":"Chiron experienced engine trouble and fell to the rear but Dreyfus developed into a serious contender for the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of lap one Caracciola arrived first with Dreyfus close behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Broschek pits to change plugs; Chiron arrives after a long interval and stops briefly.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":1,"text":"Chiron experienced engine trouble and fell to the rear but Dreyfus developed into a serious contender for the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of lap one Caracciola arrived first with Dreyfus close behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Broschek pits to change plugs; Chiron arrives after a long interval and stops briefly.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":3,"text":"The heavy Mercedes-Benz of von Brauchitsch and Stuck could not keep up with the nimble grand prix cars out front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":3,"text":"The heavy Mercedes-Benz of von Brauchitsch and Stuck could not keep up with the nimble grand prix cars out front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":5,"text":"At the end of lap five it began to rain for a short while. Broscheck and Chiron both stopped again at their pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":5,"text":"At the end of lap five it began to rain for a short while. Broscheck and Chiron both stopped again at their pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":6,"text":"On lap six it was still raining and lap speeds came down for a while but positions did not change.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":6,"text":"On lap six it was still raining and lap speeds came down for a while but positions did not change.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":10,"text":"After the tenth lap the circuit dried up noticeably and lap speeds of all drivers increased.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":10,"text":"The 800 cc class finishes: Macher's streamlined DKW wins from Simons and Stoll.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":10,"text":"After the tenth lap the circuit dried up noticeably and lap speeds of all drivers increased.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":10,"text":"The 800 cc class finishes: Macher's streamlined DKW wins from Simons and Stoll.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":11,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti was finally running well, although he was now too far back to threaten even Stuck's Mercedes in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":11,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti was finally running well, although he was now too far back to threaten even Stuck's Mercedes in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":12,"text":"Caracciola raises his pace.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"Caracciola raises his pace.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Caracciola laps in 11m42.8s on the final lap.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Dreyfus never posed a real thread and finished 22 seconds behind Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":14,"text":"Von Brauchitsch had the fastest Mercedes and finished third, followed by Stuck in the second SSKL.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":14,"text":"Broschek, without his supercharger near the end, finishes over 34 minutes behind.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":14,"text":"T\u00e4uber wins the 1500 cc class in 3h07m24s.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":14,"text":"Caracciola laps in 11m42.8s on the final lap.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Dreyfus never posed a real thread and finished 22 seconds behind Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":14,"text":"Von Brauchitsch had the fastest Mercedes and finished third, followed by Stuck in the second SSKL.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":14,"text":"Broschek, without his supercharger near the end, finishes over 34 minutes behind.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":14,"text":"T\u00e4uber wins the 1500 cc class in 3h07m24s.","q":false,"c":1}]}